1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,497
By about thirty two cells, a fluid filled cavity appears inside: the blastocoel.

2
00:00:06,497 --> 00:00:10,299
The embryo is now a hollow ball, a blastula.

3
00:00:10,299 --> 00:00:17,148
The heavy yolky macromeres crowd the bottom, so the cavity is pushed up into the animal half.

4
00:00:17,148 --> 00:00:18,424
It is eccentric.

